## 3. 建表与触发器清单（查 pg_tables / pg_trigger）

- 表（11 张）：alembic_version, asst_conversation, asst_export_job, asst_export_token, asst_hash_chain, asst_hash_chain_run, asst_purge_guard, asst_purge_marker, asst_trail, asst_trail_counter, audit_log
- 触发器（3 个）：
  - trg_asst_hash_chain_append_only ON asst_hash_chain
  - trg_asst_trail_immutable ON asst_trail
  - trg_audit_log_append_only ON audit_log
- alembic_version：[('0001_initial',)]

## 4. 只增不改触发器实证

### 4.1 篡改 payload（UPDATE 非白名单列）—— 应被 plpgsql 触发器 RAISE

```sql
UPDATE asst_trail SET payload = '{"content_redacted": "tampered"}'::jsonb WHERE seq = 900001;
```

```
psycopg.errors.RaiseException: TRAIL_IMMUTABLE: asst_trail is append-only; only hidden_by_user/purged_at may change
完整异常：RaiseException: TRAIL_IMMUTABLE: asst_trail is append-only; only hidden_by_user/purged_at may change
```

### 4.2 物理删除（purge 窗口未开）—— 应被 RAISE

```sql
DELETE FROM asst_trail WHERE seq = 900001;
```

```
psycopg.errors.RaiseException: TRAIL_IMMUTABLE: physical delete is reserved for the retention purge window
完整异常：RaiseException: TRAIL_IMMUTABLE: physical delete is reserved for the retention purge window
```

### 4.3 白名单列 hidden_by_user / purged_at —— 应允许更新

```sql
UPDATE asst_trail SET hidden_by_user = TRUE WHERE seq = 900001;
UPDATE asst_trail SET purged_at = now() WHERE seq = 900001;
SELECT hidden_by_user, purged_at IS NOT NULL AS purged FROM asst_trail WHERE seq = 900001;
```

```
结果：hidden_by_user = True，purged_at 已置 = True —— 白名单两列更新成功
```

### 4.4 错误布尔值（UPDATE hidden_by_user = 7）—— PG boolean 类型层直接拒绝

```sql
UPDATE asst_trail SET hidden_by_user = 7 WHERE seq = 900001;
```

```
DatatypeMismatch: 字段 "hidden_by_user" 的类型为 boolean, 但表达式的类型为 integer
```

## 5. 清理

DROP SCHEMA "asst_pgverify_e1a2ebb39e" CASCADE 已执行；残留同名 schema 计数 = 0
